# vercel
.vercel

# The Brahui learning app keeps its own git repository, its 3.8 MB source lexicon
# and its generator here. Only the build outputs belong to this site, and they are
# committed under public/brahui/ by `npm run sync:brahui`. Committing this folder
# would add a broken gitlink, not the files.
/Brahui-to-EN-URDU-Dictionary/

